    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// A Balkan-flavoured dance tune: the phrase is in 7/8 and the refrain answers" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// in 4/4, which is ordinary in folk music and was inexpressible in musa until" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// the meter learned to change where the music changes." },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "//" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// The `meter` statements are written among the voice's own items, at the" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// place they take effect — not as a coordinate, because a measure number is a" },
    { "kind": "comment", "text": "// position in bars and where the bars fall is what the meter decides." },
